# =============================================================================
# .logpilotignore
# =============================================================================
#
# This file specifies paths and patterns that the LogPilot repository
# intelligence system must exclude from scanning, indexing, and LLM context
# construction.
#
# Purpose:
#   - Prevent secrets, credentials, and sensitive material from being
#     ingested into the intelligence pipeline or sent to LLM providers.
#   - Exclude large/binary/generated directories that provide no analytical
#     value and waste compute.
#
# Syntax:
#   - Follows .gitignore pattern syntax.
#   - Lines starting with # are comments.
#   - Blank lines are ignored.
#   - Patterns are matched relative to the repository root.
#
# Security note:
#   This file is a defense-in-depth measure. The repository intelligence
#   system must ALSO apply built-in secret detection and redaction
#   regardless of this file's contents.
#
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and credentials
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
credentials*
secrets*
**/secret/**
**/secrets/**
**/credentials/**
*.keystore
*.truststore
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.gpg

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
